   "title": "Read me first",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## 06 · Canvas from a latent\n\nThe same Cutter as example 05, with one difference: the frame size comes from a\n*node*. An **Empty Latent Image** is wired into `latent_image`, and its size\ndecides the canvas while the wire is connected. Swap it for a portrait latent\nand the whole film is re-framed.\n\nEverything else happens inside the node, per clip: write the script, **Process\nwith agent**, **Generate segment**. No `ref_model` is wired here, so keep the\nclips in the base modes (T2VA/I2VA/FL2VA/L2VA)."
   ]
  },
